    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i wont use the aspirin. but the ibuprofen isn't really working that well and he's still so sleepy and just won't wake up properly. i'm worried he might be dehydrated or something but i don't want to take him to the ER if it's just a normal virus. can i just try giving him some Pedialyte and some more ibuprofen every few hours until he perks up? it's late and the clinic is closed.",
